  "summary": "The Rugby 640 is the multipurpose member of the 600 series: horizontal, vertical, and 90 degrees, with manual slope in two axes, scanning modes, and the RC400 remote control. It works inside and outside, in formwork, on pads, and on suspended ceilings.\n\nAccuracy is +/- 2.2 mm at 30 m, the working diameter reaches 500 m with a Rod Eye 120 and 600 m with the Rod Eye 140 or 160, and the RC400 remote reaches 200 m. Up to 80 hours on Li-ion and IP67 for the site.\n\nThe 640G variant swaps the red laser for a 520 nm green beam, which is far easier to see indoors against bright finishes and long-distance haze.",
